OL,3,AHundreds complain about I'm A Celebrity
OL,4,Aafter Mariella Frostrup called AJ Odudu
OL,5,A'aggressive'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfcom said 887 people had filed
OL,8,Fcomplaints about Sunday's episode in
OL,9,Frelation to "alleged bullying
OL,10,Fbehaviour" by Frostrup towards Odudu.
OL,12,FThe pair were seen clearing the air on
OL,13,FTuesday, with broadcaster Frostrup
OL,14,Fsaying she was "sorry for calling you
OL,15,Faggressive" and Odudu telling her it is
OL,16,F"a strong word to use in casual
OL,17,Fscenarios, particularly towards black
OL,18,Fwomen".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
